OL,3,GNEWSAFire stations broken into and
OL,4,Aequipment stolen
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating after two fire
OL,7,Fstations were broken into and equipment
OL,8,Fwas stolen.
OL,10,FSuffolk Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,11,Fits Brandon and Bungay stations were
OL,12,Ftargeted over the weekend.
OL,14,FSpecialist rescue equipment, power
OL,15,Ftools and other items were stolen
OL,16,Fbefore the incidents were reported to
OL,17,FSuffolk Police.
OL,19,FA spokesperson for the fire service
OL,20,Fsaid breaking into fire stations and
OL,21,Fstealing equipment was "appalling and
OL,22,Fcompletely unacceptable".
